## 3. Machine Learning Architecture & Preprocessing Pipeline
- **Three-Dataset Discipline:** 125,973 training records (`KDDTrain+.txt`), 15% validation split, and 22,544 isolated test records (`KDDTest+.txt`).
- **Feature Pipeline (`ColumnTransformer`):** `OneHotEncoder` on 3 categorical features (`protocol_type`, `service`, `flag`) and `MinMaxScaler` on 38 numerical features, fitted strictly on the training partition.
- **Class Imbalance Handling:** Synthetic Minority Over-sampling Technique (**SMOTE**) applied exclusively within training folds.
- **Model Classifier:** Serialized **Random Forest Classifier (200 Estimators)** achieving a **Macro F1-Score of 0.86** and **Macro Recall of 0.84**.
- **Inference Speed:** Verified automated latency of **0.042 seconds per record**, satisfying the sub-second constraint (<1.0s).

