## 4. Responsible AI & Advisory Guardrails
- **Human-in-the-Loop:** Designed strictly as an advisory decision-support system.
- **100% Non-Enforcement Boundary:** Operates without automated packet dropping or active firewall manipulation.
- **Explainability:** Features integrated **SHAP force and summary attribution plots** to give SOC analysts actionable context behind every threat prediction.

